Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.45,0:00:59.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs17\bord1\shad1\1c&HFFE0EC&\3c&HFF8000&\b0}我可以只收礼物  而仍然是29岁吗{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs8\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Well, can I keep the presents and still be 29?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.50,0:01:04.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs17\bord1\shad1\1c&HFFE0EC&\3c&HFF8000&\b0}瑞秋  30岁也没什么大不了的{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs8\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Come on, Rach, look, turning 3O is not that big a deal.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.34,0:01:07.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs17\bord1\shad1\1c&HFFE0EC&\3c&HFF8000&\b0}真的嘛  你满30岁时也是这么觉得吗{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs8\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Oh, really? Is that how you felt when you turned 30?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.34,0:01:09.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs17\bord1\shad1\1c&HFFE0EC&\3c&HFF8000&\b0}为什么  上帝  为什么啊{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs8\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Why, God, why?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.01,0:01:14.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs17\bord1\shad1\1c&HFFE0EC&\3c&HFF8000&\b0}我们讲好的了  让其他人变老  我不要{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs8\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}We had a deal. Let the others grow old, not me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.18,0:01:19.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs17\bord1\shad1\1c&HFFE0EC&\3c&HFF8000&\b0}只有我这样吗  是我反应过度吗{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs8\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Oh, come on, you guys, is it just me? Am I overreacting to this?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.02,0:01:24.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs16\bord1\shad1\1c&HFFE0EC&\3c&HFF8000&\b0}不  不是只有你  我的30岁生日也不好过{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs8\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}No, Rach, it is not just you. My 30th birthday certainly wasn't that much fun.{\r}
