Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.07,0:01:33.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs17\bord1\shad1\1c&HFFE0EC&\3c&HFF8000&\b0}为什么这样对我们{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs8\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Why are you doing this to us'?{\r}
