Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.62,0:02:21.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs16\bord1\shad1\1c&HFFE0EC&\3c&HFF8000&\b0}你的生活过得很好  有很棒的工作  很好的朋友{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs8\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Rach, you're in a great place in your life. You have an amazing job, good friends.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.54,0:02:23.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs17\bord1\shad1\1c&HFFE0EC&\3c&HFF8000&\b0}你的室友是连续剧明星{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs8\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Yeah, your roommate's a soap opera star.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.92,0:02:25.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs17\bord1\shad1\1c&HFFE0EC&\3c&HFF8000&\b0}你的角色在昏迷中{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs8\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Your character is in a coma.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.00,0:02:30.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs17\bord1\shad1\1c&HFFE0EC&\3c&HFF8000&\b0}我答应自己这个生日一定不哭{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs8\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}I promised myself I wasn't gonna cry at this one.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.51,0:02:36.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs17\bord1\shad1\1c&HFFE0EC&\3c&HFF8000&\b0}我知道我目前过得很好  但我看到一些人{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs8\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}I know my life's going pretty well, but I see so many people...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.30,0:02:39.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs17\bord1\shad1\1c&HFFE0EC&\3c&HFF8000&\b0}在30岁以前  就完成了他们的目标{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs8\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}...who've accomplished so many of their goals by the time they're 30.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.89,0:02:42.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs17\bord1\shad1\1c&HFFE0EC&\3c&HFF8000&\b0}是啊  你不应该和我比{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs8\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Yeah, but you shouldn't compare yourself to me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.85,0:02:46.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs17\bord1\shad1\1c&HFFE0EC&\3c&HFF8000&\b0}来  菲比  你做得到的{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs8\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Come on, Phoebe. You can do it Phoebe! Come on!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.52,0:02:48.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs17\bord1\shad1\1c&HFFE0EC&\3c&HFF8000&\b0}来了  好了{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs8\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Come on. There you go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.11,0:02:58.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs17\bord1\shad1\1c&HFFE0EC&\3c&HFF8000&\b0}我成功了  在跳跳球上走了一哩{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs8\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}I did it. One mile on a Hippity Hop.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.99,0:03:02.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs17\bord1\shad1\1c&HFFE0EC&\3c&HFF8000&\b0}30岁前我想完成的事{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs8\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}That's it. That's everything I wanted to do before I was 30.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.41,0:03:05.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs17\bord1\shad1\1c&HFFE0EC&\3c&HFF8000&\b0}除了我想和我妹修好关系外{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs8\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Oh, except I wanted to patch things up with my sister.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.50,0:03:06.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs17\bord1\shad1\1c&HFFE0EC&\3c&HFF8000&\b0}嗯  可是{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs8\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Oh, well. But, yaw.!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.67,0:03:12.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs16\bord1\shad1\1c&HFFE0EC&\3c&HFF8000&\b0}女人  这东西是上帝给的礼物  如果你懂我的意思{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs8\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}And, girls, this thing is a godsend, if you know what I mean. Heh.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.06,0:03:25.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs17\bord1\shad1\1c&HFFE0EC&\3c&HFF8000&\b0}来做点有趣的事吧  今天你想做什么{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs8\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Come on, let's have some fun, huh? What do you want to do today?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.56,0:03:27.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs17\bord1\shad1\1c&HFFE0EC&\3c&HFF8000&\b0}什么也不做   我什么也不想做{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs8\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Nothing. I don't want to do anything.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.52,0:03:32.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs16\bord1\shad1\1c&HFFE0EC&\3c&HFF8000&\b0}在30岁生日时什么都不做  总比像罗斯一样做傻事好{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs8\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Well, doing nothing on your 30th is better than doing something stupid, like Ross.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.60,0:03:36.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs17\bord1\shad1\1c&HFFE0EC&\3c&HFF8000&\b0}那是很实际的一次购买{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs8\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Hey, that was a practical purchase.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.45,0:03:38.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs17\bord1\shad1\1c&HFFE0EC&\3c&HFF8000&\b0}我需要那个车子做交通工具{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs8\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}I needed that car for transportation.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.95,0:03:41.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs17\bord1\shad1\1c&HFFE0EC&\3c&HFF8000&\b0}好吗  我有小孩{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs8\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Okay? I have a child.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.79,0:03:44.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs17\bord1\shad1\1c&HFFE0EC&\3c&HFF8000&\b0}我在这车里看来很拉风吧{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs8\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}How hot do I look in this, huh?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.62,0:03:47.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs17\bord1\shad1\1c&HFFE0EC&\3c&HFF8000&\b0}罗斯  一台跑车{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs8\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Ross, a sports car?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.37,0:03:50.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs17\bord1\shad1\1c&HFFE0EC&\3c&HFF8000&\b0}在裤子里塞袜子不是比较便宜{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs8\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Wouldn't it be cheaper to just stuff a sock down there?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.59,0:03:53.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs17\bord1\shad1\1c&HFFE0EC&\3c&HFF8000&\b0}这不是为了那个{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs8\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}That's not what this is about, okay?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.88,0:03:56.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs17\bord1\shad1\1c&HFFE0EC&\3c&HFF8000&\b0}我是跑车爱好者{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs8\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}I am a sports car enthusiast.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.38,0:04:00.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs17\bord1\shad1\1c&HFFE0EC&\3c&HFF8000&\b0}我一直都很喜欢车  它的马力多少{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs8\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}I've always been into cars. What's the horsepower on this thing?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.60,0:04:02.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs17\bord1\shad1\1c&HFFE0EC&\3c&HFF8000&\b0}不知道  看看它多亮呀{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs8\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}I don't know, but look how shiny.{\r}
